<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timutawus</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tim</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timutawus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Bulus ɣar Timutawus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Bulus ɣar Timutawus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus ḏ arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s lʼamar n Arebbi wenni iy ḏaneɣ isenajmen ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ netta ḏ lʼamal nneɣ. <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" /><char style="it">Tariɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i Timutawus wenni iy iǧan am memmi ḏ ṣṣaḥ ḏi lʼiman. Akiḏec yiȓi arḍa ḏ arraḥmeṯ ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yinni iseȓmaḏen ixarriqen waha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Nec wami ruḥeɣ ɣar lʼiqlim n Masidunya weṣṣiɣ-cek aḏ teqqimeḏ ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus bac aḏ tenhiḏ can iryazen aḏasen ṯiniḏ war seȓmaḏem ca ṯimesȓayin ig itxalafen ḏi lʼiman. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Aḏasen ṯiniḏ war ḏeffarem ca ṯiḥuja niɣ ḏ ṯacejjarṯ nni war iqeṭṭin ca x ȓejḏuḏ nwem. Ṯimesȓayin-a am ṯina ɣir tsejjaƹent-aneɣ bac a nweddar ḏi lʼafkar ixwan, war ḏaneɣ ṯsiwwiḍent ca ɣar min itxeṭṭeṭ Arebbi minzi min ḏaneɣ isawwaḍen ɣar Arebbi netta ḏ lʼiman. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Min iƹna lɣaraḍ n ȓuṣiyeṯ-a? Lɣaraḍ nnes ḏ ijjen n ȓemḥibbeṯ iy d itasen zeg wuȓawen iṣfan ḏ yijjen n ḍḍamir ḏ aṣebḥan ḏ yijjen n lʼiman bȓa nnifaq. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Ȓebƹaḍ ffɣen zi ṯmesȓayin-a uḏfen ḏeg wawaȓen iy ixwan. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Rezzun aḏ dewȓen ḏ imseȓmaḏen n ccariƹa, walakin war fehhmen ca min qqaren uȓa ḏ minxef tʼakkaden aṭṭas.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Ccariƹa-ya meȓa isteƹmel-it bnaḏem nican, neccin nessen-it ḏ ṯaṣebḥant. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Nessen Ccariƹa-ya ƹaweḏ war d ṯexȓiq ca i yinni isemṣȓaḥen ak Arebbi. Lla, ṯexȓeq-d i yinni iǧan ḏ iƹeffanen ḏ yinni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ṯɣennant ḏ yinni war iḏeffiren ca Arebbi ḏ yinni iƹeṣṣan ḏ yinni war iṣfin ca ḏ yinni war ɣar iǧi bu ddin ḏ yinni ineqqen babaṯsen ḏ yemmaṯsen ḏ yinni ineqqen iwḏan <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />ḏ yinni iteggen lfasad ḏ iryazen ifessḏen ak wayawya ḏ yinni itacaren iwḏan ḥima aṯen arren ḏ isemɣan ḏ yinni iqqaren ixarriqen ḏ yinni icehhḏen ẓẓur niɣ ḏ yinni iteggen can n ṯmesȓayin nneɣni iǧan ḍed i ttaƹlim n lʼiman iǧan nican. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Ttaƹlim-a iǧan nican aṯ naf ḏi Lʼinjil n Arebbi lƹaḍim ig itwarbarken. Lʼinjil-a ikellef-ayi-d xas nec am yijjen n lʼamana.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itcekkar Siḏiṯneɣ x arḍa nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Tcekkareɣ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni iy ḏayi yucin jjheḏ nnes yufa ḏayi ttiqeṯ isiḏef-ayi ɣar ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Nec qbeȓ tuɣa qqareɣ awaȓen war iḥȓin x Arebbi tƹeddabeɣ ȓmuminin, nec ḏ ijjen bnaḏem iḍeǧmen. Waxxa tuɣa xeḏmeɣ manayenni iseḍhar-ayi-d Arebbi arraḥmeṯ nnes liʼanna xeḏmeɣ manayenni s ȓeqfaȓeṯ inu bȓa ma aḏ ssneɣ min iǧan nican, uȓ inu war ḏayes bu lʼiman. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ infeyyeḍ-d xafi s waṭṭas ḏ waṭṭas, akiḏes ijjen n lʼiman ḏ ijjen n ȓemḥibbeṯ ig iǧan ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Aqa ijjen n wawaȓ ḏayes ttiqeṯ u labud aḏ itwaqbeȓ marra, iƹni Ƹisa Lmasiḥ yusa-d ɣar ddunect-a bac aḏ isenjem yinni iƹeṣṣan, zzaysen nec ig iǧan ḏ lƹaṣi ḏ ameqqran xasen marra. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Wami nec ḏ lƹaṣi ḏ ameqqran xasen marra iseḍhar-ayi-d Arebbi arraḥmeṯ nnes bac Ƹisa Lmasiḥ azzayi d ismeḍhar marra ṣṣbar nnes aḏ yiȓi manaya ḏ ijjen n lmiṯal i yinni iy zzayes ɣa yamnen aɣarsen ṯiȓi ṯuḏarṯ n ȓebda. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Azeǧiḏ nneɣ aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ, wenni ƹemmarṣ aḏ ifna ƹemmarṣ aḏ immeṯ wenni war ṯ itwiȓi ḥadd wenni iǧan ḏ Arebbi waḥḏes. Amin.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lmasʼuliya ig iticc arrasul Bulus i Timutawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />A wulidi Timutawus, aḏac uceɣ lmasʼuliya-ya ṯanitan ƹlaḥsab awaȓen nni iy xac nnan lʼanbiya zi qbeȓ bac xmi xasen ɣa ṯƹeqȓeḏ ataf aḏ tmenɣeḏ mliḥ amenɣi-ya aṣebḥan, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />ataf aɣarec yiȓi lʼiman nnec ḏ yijjen ḍḍamir ḏ aṣebḥan. Maci am ȓebƹaḍiṯ semḥen ḏi manaya uca lʼiman nsen iɣareq am yij uɣarrabu ḏi ȓebḥar. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Zzaysen Ḥimmit ḏ Iskander, jjiɣ-ṯen nec i Cciṭan ḥima aḏ twarebban war qqaren ca awaȓen nni war iḥȓin x Arebbi.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ x lƹibada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Ḏ amezwaru tweṣṣiɣ-kenniw aḏ tettarem i Arebbi aṯ tedƹim aṯ ṭelbem aṯ tcekkarem x marra iwḏan <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />ḏ izeǧiḏen ḏ marra yinni iḥekkmen bac a nƹiceṯ ḏeg yijjen n ȓehna bȓa ssdaƹ ḏeg yijjen n ṭṭaƹa n Arebbi ḏ yijjen n lmaƹqul. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Manaya ḏ aṣebḥan yarḍa xas Arebbi iy ḏaneɣ d isnejmen, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />ixes marra iwḏan aḏ twasnejmen aḏ awḍen aḏ ssnen lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Liʼanna ḏinni ijjen n Arebbi waḥḏes ḏ yijjen lwasiṭ waḥḏes jar Arebbi ḏ yiwḏan iƹni aryaz-a ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Netta iṣeddeq ṯuḏarṯ nnes ḏ ijjen n lfidya bac azzayes isenjem marra iwḏan, manaya aḏ itwacheḏ ḏi ȓweqṯ nnes. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />X manayenni iy twaxḍareɣ nec bac aḏ ḥeddṯeɣ aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ arrasul aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ amseȓmaḏ ƹlaḥsab lʼiman ḏ ȓḥaqq jar yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Qqareɣ lmaƹqul maci ḏ ixarriqen. <verse eid="1TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Falihaḏa xseɣ iryazen ḏi marra imucan aḏ ẓẓaǧen aḏ ysin ifassen nsen iṣfan ɣar ujenna bȓa ma aḏ tƹeṣṣben bȓa ma aḏ tmenɣan.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Amenni ƹaweḏ xseɣ ṯimɣarin aḏaysent yiȓi lʼiḥtiram aḏaysent yiȓi ȓeḥya ḏ lmaƹqul, maci aḏ qqiment s ucewwaf iḍȓeq aṭṭas niɣ s ddheb ḏ jjuwhar ḏ warruḍ iy iɣȓan. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Lla, aḏ ṣarent ixef nsent s lḥasanaṯ ig iǧan labud ḏi ṯemɣarin nni iqqaren qa neccin nƹebbeḏ Arebbi.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Ṯamɣarṯ u labud aḏ teȓmeḏ s ṭṭaƹa ḏ ȓhudneṯ. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Nec war tejjiɣ ca ṯamɣarṯ aḏ tseȓmeḏ aryaz niɣ axas ṯeḥkem; Lla, labud aḏ tiȓi mhedna. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Mayemmi? Arebbi ixȓeq-d Adam ḏ amezwaru, ƹaḏ iy d ixȓeq Ḥawwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Ƹaweḏ Adam war ṯ icmiṯ ca Cciṭan, ḏ ṯamɣarṯ itwacemṯen ṯeƹṣa Arebbi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Ṯamɣarṯ aḏ twasenjem ƹlaḥsab ṯarwa walakin itxeṣṣa wa labud aḏ qqiment niṯenti ḏi lʼiman ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ ȓeṣfiyeṯ ƹlaḥsab lmaƹqul.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Yinni itrayyan x jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Aqa ijjen n wawaȓ ḏayes ttiqeṯ iƹni wenni irezzun aḏ yiȓi ḏ arrayes n jmaƹeṯ qa irezzu ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Fa arrayes n jmaƹeṯ maci am yijjen n bnaḏem iy tƹeyyaben yiwḏan. U labud aɣares ṯiȓi ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ waha. U labud aḏ iḥkem x yixef nnes aḏayes yiȓi lmaƹqul ḏ lʼiḥtiram aḏ itreḥḥab zeg inewjiwen aɣares ṯiȓi ṯzemmar aḏ iseȓmeḏ iwḏan. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Itxeṣṣa war itegg ca lmadla n ssekra, war icciṯ ca aḏ yiȓi trankiȓ. Itxeṣṣa war itmenɣi ca s wawaȓ, war iḍemmeƹ ca ḏi tmenyaṯ. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Aḏ yiȓi ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem ig iḥekkmen x ṯeddarṯ nnes mliḥ, tṭaƹan-as iḥenjiren nnes tseḏḥan-ṯ. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Iwa bnaḏem-a meȓa war issin ca aḏ iḥkem x ṯeddarṯ nnes, mammec iy ɣa igg aḏ itraya x jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Arrayes-a, maci yallah iy isȓem aḏ yuff s ttakebbur <char style="it">x ȓxeḏmeṯ-a</char> aḏ iwḍa ḏi lƹuquba nni n Ibȓis. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />U labud ƹaweḏ aṯ weqqaren yinni iǧan n barra war iǧin ca ḏ ȓmuminin bac war xas tƹeyyiben ca yiwḏan war iweṭṭi ca ḏi ṯexcebṯ nni n Ibȓis.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Amenni ƹaweḏ imsexxaren u labud aḏ iȓin mweqqerin aɣarsen yiȓi wawaȓ, ataf war sessen ca aṭṭas n ccreb war ḍemmƹen ca ḏi ȓewsex n ddunect-a. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Imsexxaren-a itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ ṭṭfen ḏi ȓmaƹna inuffaren n lʼiman s yijjen n ḍḍamir iṣfa. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Ḏ amezwaru aḏ twajarrben. Meȓa war ḏinni can n ṯmesȓayṯ ḍed nsen, ataf aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ imsexxaren.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Amenni ƹaweḏ ṯimɣarin itxeṣṣa aḏ iȓint mweqqerint war ḏaysent tiȓi ca nnamima aḏ ḥekkment x yixef nsent aḏaysent ṯiȓi ttiqeṯ ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin.<verse eid="1TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Imsexxaren itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ iȓin ḏ iryazen n yijjen n ṯemɣarṯ waha, aḏ ḥekkmen x iḥenjiren ḏ ṯuḏrin nsen mliḥ. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Aqa imsexxaren ig ixeddmen mliḥ aḏ rebḥen i yixef nsen ijjen n ddaraja ḏ ṯaṣebḥant ḏ yijjen n ttiqeṯ ḏi lʼiman nsen ig iǧan ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ssabab n ȓuṣiyaṯ-a n arrasul Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ṯimesȓayin-a tariɣ-ṯent-id i cek, nec tmenniɣ aɣarec d aseɣ ḏeɣya. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Meȓa ṭewwleɣ aṭṭas war ḏinni d usiɣ ca, ataf aḏ tessneḏ cek mamc iy ɣa suguren yiwḏan ixef nsen ḏi ṯeddarṯ n Arebbi iƹni jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi iddaren ḏ nettaṯ iy iǧan ḏ apilar ḏ dsas n lḥaqiqa.<verse eid="1TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />U bȓa ccekk mecḥaȓ ṯeǧa ḏ ṯameqqrant ȓmaƹna inuffaren n lʼiman:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">
    <char style="bd">Netta, ḏ bnaḏem iy d imeḍharen, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">
    <char style="bd">ḏ Arruḥ iy xas icehḏen. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">
    <char style="bd">Netta, ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ iy ḏayes ixzaren, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">
    <char style="bd">ḏ ȓegnus iy zzayes itwabeccaren. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">
    <char style="bd">Netta, ḏi ddunect-a yinni iy zzayes yumnen, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">
    <char style="bd">ḏ lƹaḍama n ujenna iy ṯ iqebȓen. </char><verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ n arrasul Bulus i Timutawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Fa iqqar Arruḥ iqeddsen nican bȓa ccekk ḏeg wussan-a ineggura aḏ semḥen ca n yiwḏan ḏi lʼiman nican aḏ ggen array i jnun iɣeddaren ḏ min seȓmaḏen ccayaṭin. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Aḏ yiȓi manaya s nnifaq n iryazen isxarriqen, ḍḍamir nsen ṣafi iḥareq mamc iy ṯ iḥareq ijjen n warcem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arcem n wuzzeȓ ḏ ijjen wuzzeȓ teggeḏ ḏi ṯmessi teqqḏeḏ zzayes.</char></note> n wuzzeȓ issecmaḍen. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Niṯni aḏ sbedden iwḏan bac war meǧcen ca, qqaren-asen ƹaweḏ qa ca n lmaklaṯ memnuƹ aṯent ccen. Walakin lmaklaṯ nni ixȓeq-iṯent-id Arebbi aṯent neqbeȓ neccin ig itamnen nessen lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Qa marra min d ixȓeq Arebbi ḏ aṣebḥan. Meȓa neqbeȓ-iṯ neccin s ccuker ataf war ḏayes min ɣa nƹiff. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Aqa manaya iḥeǧeȓ ḥalal ƹlaḥsab awaȓ n Arebbi ḏ ṯẓaǧiṯ. <verse eid="1TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ṯimesȓayin-a meȓa ṯesbeyyaneḏ-ṯent-id i ayṯmaṯneɣ aḏ tiȓiḏ cek ḏ ijjen n uxeddam ḏ aṣebḥan n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, aḏ tiȓiḏ twarebbiḏ s wawaȓen n lʼiman ḏ ttaƹlim nni aṣebḥan iy ṯḏeffareḏ cek.<verse eid="1TI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Fa awggwej cek x ṯḥuja nni iǧan ḍed lʼiman iy tƹawaḏent ṯwessura waha, setrinar ixef nnec ƹlaḥsab lʼiman. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Meȓa ṯestrinareḏ ixef nnec s arriyaḍa, aḏ tawiḏ ijjen n arbaḥ ac ineffeƹ cwayt. Meȓa ṯestrinareḏ s lʼiman, aḏ tawiḏ ijjen n arbaḥ ac ineffeƹ i ṯmesȓayin marra. Lʼiman-a iwƹeḏ-ic ƹlaḥsab ṯuḏarṯ-a iǧan ȓexxu ḏ ṯenni iy d ɣa yasen. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Awaȓ-a ḏayes ttiqeṯ u labud aḏ itwaqbeȓ ikmaȓ. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />X manaya neccin nxeddem nrebbeȓ liʼanna negga lʼamal nneɣ ḏi Arebbi iddaren wenni isenjamen marra iwḏan xaṣṣatan ḏ yinni itamnen.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Ṯimesȓayin-a tweṣṣa xasent cek seȓmaḏ-iṯent. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />War tejja ḥadd ac iseḥqar ƹlaḥsab ṯemẓi nnec. Lla, cek labud aḏasen tiȓiḏ i ȓmuminin ḏ lmiṯal ƹlaḥsab awaȓen nnec ḏ ṯicri nnec ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nnec ḏ lʼiman ḏ ȓeṣfiyeṯ. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ḥetta aȓ d ɣa yaseɣ nec sxeddam ixef nnec mliḥ s ṯɣuri n Lkutub ḏ uḥeddeṯ ḏ useȓmeḏ. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />War tferraṭ ca ḏi lqudra nni iy ḏac immucen ƹlaḥsab awaȓ nni aṣebḥan iy xac nnan lʼanbiya wami ayraw n imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin sersen xac ifassen nsen.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ṭebbeq ṯimesȓayin-a, sellem-asent ixef nnec qaƹ bac aḏ ẓren marra iwḏan nnajaḥ nnec. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Xzar ḏi ṯuḏarṯ nnec ḏ ṯmesȓayin iy ṯseȓmaḏeḏ, arni ḏaysent. Liʼanna meȓa ṯeggiḏ manaya aḏ tesnejmeḏ ixef nnec ḏ yinni iy ḏac itsȓan.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ i Timutawus ƹlaḥsab ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />War nehha ca ijjen n uwessar s ȓeqsaḥeṯ; Lla, siweȓ akiḏes am babac. Iḥenjiren egg-iṯen am ayṯmac. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Ṯiwessura egg-iṯent am yemmaṯac. Ṯiḥenjirin egg-iṯent am suyṯmac s yijjen n wuȓ iṣfa.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Weqqar ṯajjaȓin ig iǧan ḏ ṯajjaȓin ḏ ṣṣaḥ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯajjaȓin, iƹni ṯimɣarin umi mmuṯen iryazen.</char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Cuf, ṯajjaȓṯ nni meȓa ɣares iḥenjiren niɣ ḏ ayyawen ataf ḏ niṯni iy t ɣa iƹawnen aḏ ȓemḏen ḏ amezwaru aḏ sxeddmen lʼiman nsen ak lƹaʼila nsen aḏ arren ȓxir i lwalidin nsen. Aqa manaya yarḍa xas Arebbi. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Qa ṯajjaȓṯ n ṣṣaḥ ṯenni war ɣar iǧi ḥadd aqa ḏ nettaṯ iteggen lʼamal nnes ḏi Arebbi tɣima tedƹa Arebbi tettar-as ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Walakin ṯenni itƹicen ḏi ccehweṯ waha, qa nettaṯ ṯemmuṯ waxxa ṯeddar. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Ṯimesȓayin-a tweṣṣa-ṯent baƹda cek bac aḏ qqimen yiwḏan bȓa ȓƹib. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Cuf, wenni war itḏebbiren x ȓeḥbab nnes xaṣṣatan x lƹaʼila nnes ataf netta inkar lʼiman, wenni war yuminen qaƹ ataf ḥsen zzayes.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />War tejja uȓa ḏ icten aḏ tsejjel ak ṯajjaȓin ɣar lmuƹawana illa meȓa ɣares zi settin iseggwusa aȓ ṯsawent, illa meȓa tuɣa ɣares ijjen n uryaz waha. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Labud aḏ tiȓi maƹrufa s lḥasanaṯ nnes iƹni meȓa ṯrebba ṯarwa nnes, treḥḥab s inewjiwen, ṯsiȓiḏ iḍaren n ṣṣaliḥin, tƹawan yinni itzeyyaren, ṯḏeffar marra ṯimesȓayin ṯiṣebḥanin.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Fa ṯajjaȓin ṯimezyanin war ṯent tsejjal ca ƹlaḥsab lmuƹawana. Niṯenti xmi ɣa ṯeḏfarent ccehawaṯ nsent ktar zi Lmasiḥ ataf rezzunt aḏ meȓcent. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Ammu aḏ twaḥekment minzi semḥent ḏi lwaƹeḏ nsent iy ggint ḏ amezwaru. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Ƹaweḏ aḏ dewȓent ḏ ṯimeƹgazin ggurent zi ṯaddarṯ ɣar ṯeddarṯ teggent farq-ccɣeȓ. Maci ḏ ṯimeƹgazin waha, tƹawaḏent ȓexburaṯ taḏfent ḏi ccɣuȓaṯ n midden qqarent ṯimesȓayin war itxeṣṣa ca aḏ twannant. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Iḏen, xseɣ ṯajjaȓin ṯimezyanin aḏ meȓcent aḏ d jjent iḥenjiren aḏ sugurent ṯaddarṯ nsent mliḥ war tejjint bu can lfurṣa i ȓaƹḏu axasent issiweȓ s ȓƹib. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Minzi ḏinni ȓebƹaḍ ṣafi ffɣent abriḏ ḏfarent Cciṭan.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Tamɣarṯ ḏ ȓmumna meȓa tiȓint akiḏes can ṯajjaȓin aḏaysent thilla u labud akiḏes qqiment axasent ṯḏebbar. Ṯina, maci ḏ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin axasent tarbu; Lla, aḏ tarbu ɣir x ṯinni iǧan ḏ ṯajjaȓin ḥḏajent ḏ ṣṣaḥ.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin yinni iteḥkamen mliḥ u labud aṯen tweqqarem ḏ ḍubli, xaṣṣatan yinni ixeddmen aṭṭas ḏeg uḥeddeṯ ḏ useȓmeḏ. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Aqa Lkitab iqqar: War ḏas tegg bu ṯacmant i ufunas nni itṣarwaṯen. Aqa ƹaweḏ axeddam ɣares ȓḥaqq aḏ itxaȓes. <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />War qebbeȓ ca ttuhmeṯ ḍed i umeqqran n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin illa meȓa ḏinni ṯnayen niɣ ṯȓaṯa n ȓechuḏ tahamen-ṯ. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Imeqqranen ig iƹeṣṣan nha-ṯen cek zzaṯ i marra iwḏan bac yinni inneɣni aḏ ggwḏen baƹda. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Aqa ƹeȓmeɣ-ac zzaṯ i Arebbi ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ itwaxḍaren qa labud aḏ teggeḏ ṯimesȓayin-a bȓa ma aḏ teggeḏ ȓfarz ak can ḥadd bȓa ma aḏ teggeḏ ƹaweḏ s wuḏemawen.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Ifassen nnec war tqeǧiq ca aṯen tserseḏ x can ḥadd,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imeqqranen n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin srusan ifassen nsen x ȓmuminin bac aḏ qebȓen lqudraṯ zi Arruḥ n Arebbi, aḏ genfan zi ȓehracaṯ, aṯen kellfen x lmesʼuliyaṯ n jmaƹeṯ.</char></note> war carrec ca ḏi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n midden. Qqim cek ṯeṣfiḏ.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />War sess ca aman waha, sew ƹaweḏ ḏrus n waman uḍiȓ ƹlaḥsab ṯakrict nnec ḏ ȓehracaṯ iy c iȓeqqfen.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Ca n ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n iryazen twameḍharent-id tizwarent-id i lƹiqab nsen, walakin ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n iryazen nneɣni axasen d xeḍȓent menbaƹd. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Ammu ƹaweḏ can n lḥasanaṯ twameḍharent-id, ƹaḏ can n lḥasanaṯ nneɣni war zemmarent ca aḏ qqiment twanuffarent.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Marra yinni iǧan ḏ isemɣan ṯḏeqqeȓ xasen ṯzayȓut nni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isemɣan tƹeddaben aṭṭas am ṯzagȓut nni n ukeccuḍ iy zi cerrzen ddwab.</char></note> wa labud aḏ fekkaren belli ayṯbab nsen sḏaheǧen marra min iǧan ḏ aweqqar bac iwḏan war tƹeyyiben ca isem n Arebbi ḏ ttaƹlim nneɣ. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Isemɣan umi ɣar iǧa ayṯbab nsen ḏ ȓmuminin wa labud aḏasen tṣennaṭen i ayṯbab nsen maci aḏasen agin aḏasen inin lla qa neccin ḏ awmaṯen. Lla, aḏasen xeḏmen ktar liʼanna ayṯbab nsen ḏ niṯni iy ɣa irebḥen zi ȓxeḏmeṯ nni u niṯni tamnen twaƹizzen.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Yinni iseȓmaḏen ixarriqen tƹejibent-asen tmenyaṯ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Ṯimesȓayin-a seȓmaḏ-iṯent cek, zeyyar xasent. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Meȓa can uryaz iseȓmeḏ can ȓḥajeṯ nneɣni war itifiq ca ak wawaȓen nican n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḏ ttaƹlim x lʼiman, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />ataf netta yuff s ttakebbur war ifehhem walu qaƹ. Ihȓec irezzu ɣir amxarwaḍ ḏ umnaqar x wawaȓen iy zi d itas ȓeḥseḏ ḏ umenɣi ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ ḏ lʼafkar ḏ ṯiƹeffanin. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Iryazen-a thewwaȓen jarasen s ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen iƹewwjen ṯweddar-asen lḥaqiqa. Tfekkaren belli lʼiman ḏ ijjen n ubriḏ bac aḏ rebḥen tmenyaṯ.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Fa lʼiman iy ḏi ṯeǧa ȓeqnaƹeṯ netta ḏ ijjen n arbaḥ ḏ ameqqran. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Ȓaḥeqqac neccin war d nuwi walu i ddunect-a, war nzemmar azzayes niysi walu. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Falihaḏa neccin nejjiwen s min ɣa necc ḏ min ɣa nareḍ ḏ arruḍ u ṣafi.<verse eid="1TI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Yinni irezzun aḏ iȓin ḏ twajar ataf aḏ twaɣarran aḏ wḍan ḏeg yijjen n ṯexcebṯ ḏ waṭṭas n ccehawaṯ ig isbuhȓuyen ig isefcaḏen ig isɣerraqen iryazen ḏi arrwina ḏ ȓefna. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Liʼanna ȓemḥibbeṯ n tmenyaṯ netta ḏ lʼaṣel n waṭṭas n lʼanwaƹ n ccarr. Ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan ig itexsen tmenyaṯ aqa ffɣen abriḏ snuqquben ixef nsen s waṭṭas n ȓeḥriqaṯ.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ṯineggura zi arrasul Bulus i Timutawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Fa cek ay aryaz n Arebbi, arweȓ zi marra manaya ḏfar min iǧan nican ḏ min ḏas iteƹjiben i Arebbi ḏ lʼiman ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ ttasiƹ n ȓxaḍar ḏ ttawaḍuƹ. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Mneɣ amenɣi nni aṣebḥan n lʼiman, ṭṭef ḏi ṯuḏarṯ nni war ifennin ca aȓ ḏac d iȓaɣa Arebbi wami ṯcehḏeḏ chaḏeṯ nni ṯaṣebḥant zzaṯ i waṭṭas n ȓechuḏ. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Tweṣṣiɣ-cek zzaṯ i Arebbi wenni iseddaren qaƹ ṯimesȓayin u zzaṯ i Ƹisa Lmasiḥ wenni icehḏen chaḏeṯ nni ṯaṣebḥant zzaṯ i lḥakem Bunṭus Bilaṭus. <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Tegg s ȓuṣiyeṯ-a bȓa ȓƹib bȓa ca n uxciw aȓ d ɣa imeḍhar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Aṯiḏ ismeḍhar Arebbi ḏi ȓweqṯ iy ḏi ixes netta iƹni Arebbi ḏ wenni ig itwabarken ḏ wenni ig iteḥkamen waḥḏes netta ḏ Azeǧiḏ n izeǧiḏen ḏ Mawlana n lmawlanaṯ. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Ḏ netta waḥḏes iy war itmettin ƹemmarṣ, izeddeɣ ḏeg yijjen n nnur iy war izemmar ḥadd aɣares d iqarreb iƹni wenni umi ƹemmarṣ war ṯ iẓri bnaḏem war izemmar aṯ iẓer. Ḏ netta iy ɣa yiȓi uweqqar ḏ jjheḏ i ȓebda. Amin.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Yinni ig iǧan ḏ twajar ḏi ddunect-a iy ḏi neǧa tweṣṣa-ṯen bac war ḏaysen itiȓi ca ttakebbur bac war teggen ca lʼamal nsen ḏeg wagȓa ḏi war ṯeǧi bu ttiqeṯ. Lla, aḏ yiȓi lʼamal nsen ḏi Arebbi wenni iy ḏaneɣ itḏebbaren marra ṯimesȓayin s ȓxir azzaysent nfareḥ. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Tweṣṣa-ṯen aḏ ggen ȓxir aḏ iȓin ḏ twajar ƹlaḥsab lḥasanaṯ aḏ iȓin ṣaxiyin aḏ iȓin wejḏen bac aḏ ṣeddqen aḏ ḏebbaren. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Amenni iy ɣa xemȓen agȓa i yixef nsen am yijjen n dsas ijehḏen i ṯuḏarṯ iy d ɣa yasen bac aḏ ṭṭfen mliḥ ḏi ṯuḏarṯ nni iy iǧan ḏ ṯuḏarṯ n ṣṣaḥ.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />A Timutawus, ḥḍa minxef tkellafeḏ qbeȓ. Awggwej zi min tperpiren yinni war yuminen ca ḏ lʼafkar nni iy ḏaneɣ itƹarraḍen qqaren-as Lƹarfaniya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lƹarfaniya nettaṯ ḏ ijjen n nnuƹ n lfelsafa.</char></note> walakin manayenni ḏ ixarriqen waha. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Ḏinni ȓebƹaḍ ḏfaren Lƹarfaniya-ya zaƹma menbaƹd ffɣen abriḏ n lʼiman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Aɣarwem yiȓi arḍa i kenniw.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>